        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Panic Device Keyed Outside Handleset</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Classroom Function (with thumb lift) Handleset (key locks and unlocks thumb lift) for Global Door Controls  <a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\"><b>ED-501ALARM Alarm Push Bar Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-al\"><b>ED-501-AL Push Bar Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-al\"><b>ED-VR531 Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-alarm-exit-device-global-ed-vr531alarm-al\"><b>ED-VR531ALARM Alarm Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global ED-TP501-AL Thumb Lift  Handleset \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Key locks and unlocks the thumb lift. When unlocked pushing the thumb lift down unlatches the exit device for opening door from exterior.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Height: 13-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 6-pin Schlage C Keyway Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
